    "text": "Which of the following is/are correct for the first order reaction?<br />\r<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/53b40de8-ac23-449e-a6b0-8570c43fad4e.png\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width:5.59375in;height:1.48681in\" />",
